  "meta": {
    "description": "Agent tool. Writes the chosen services to the DealerBook reservation (PATCH) and returns up to maxSlotsOffered (market row, default three) bookable timeslots in the market's window from a date, for the session's reservation (new booking) or the existing booking's offer (reschedule). Inputs: sessionId (plumbed), serviceIds, fromDate (YYYY-MM-DD). Side effect: stores the selected services and the offered slots on the session so BookAppointment and MoveAppointment can validate the choice."
  },
